  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Syria Regional Appeal - Lebanon - Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agency will support a total of 168,700 Palestine refugees through MPCA, including 23,200 PRS and approximately 145,500 PRL. PRS will receive US$ 25 per person per month, along with an additional US$ 60 per household per month, due to heightened vulnerabilities, including the inability to renew residency permits as of May 2024. Assistance to PRL will be based on specific vulnerability criteria: individuals registered under the Agency&#x2019;s Social Safety Net Programme (SSNP), families with children under the age of 18, persons with chronic illnesses, the elderly (60+), and persons with disabilities. These PRL individuals will receive US$ 50 per person on a quarterly basis.</narrative>
  </description>
